  "title": "Air Fryer Vegetarian Cauliflower and Chickpea Tacos",
  "description": "For a vegetarian twist on tacos, fill your tortillas with a seasoned cauliflower and chickpea mix that&#39;s cooked in the air fryer and topped with a creamy cilantro sauce.",
